Z||000005||DR650SE||10-26-2001||02:26 PM||||What you missed was that He and I were talking online on AOL for quite a while looking at wireing diagrams.  He told me to check the fuse.  I insisted that I had several times.  When we finsihed I went outside and pondered for a few more hours.  Then I replace the fuse and a new relay and it worked.  I should have listened.  ( Thanks for the info Johny Bravo!)  You really couldn't see that the fuse was blown but it was.  also the relay was bad.<P>------------------<BR>2 Black 86 SE's V-6 4-SPD||||reg||6
